  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Desarrollo de los Servicios Pblicos Agropecuarios del Ecuador (DSPA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Development of Agricultural Public Services in Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es mejorar la productividad agropecuaria y la seguridad alimentaria del Ecuador. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar la capacidad de investigacin, desarrollo e innovacin yla adopcin de tecnologas agropecuarias, considerando la sostenibilidad ambiental, la resiliencia climtica y la inclusin degnero y diversidad; y (ii) mejorar la eficiencia y efectividad de los servicios de sanidad animal, vegetal e inocuidad de los alimentos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the development of public agricultural services in Ecuador to enhance the competitiveness of the sector and agricultural exports. Specific Objectives: 1. Improve the productivity and sustainability of agri-food systems and ensure food security and climate resilience by increasing research, innovation, and technology transfer capacity. 2. Enhance phytosanitary, zoosanitary, and food safety services to ensure both the exportable supply and the domestic consumption of safe food in its primary production phase, through the expansion of laboratory analytical capacity, the implementation of service automation, and the adoption of new technologies in information systems.</narrative>
  </description>
